{"id":"beats-7991a9","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-a906a62d-e867-40fd-978a-a9068374991e","text":"## Changes\n\n### 1. Parent property in sidebar\n- Added a \"Parent\" row to the properties card in the issue detail sidebar\n- Clicking it opens a searchable popover listing candidate parent issues\n- Filters out the issue itself and its descendants to prevent circular references\n- Only shows top-level issues (no nested parents) as candidates\n- Shows \"Remove parent\" option when a parent is already set\n- Search filters by title and issue ID\n\n### 2. Add sub-issue from parent detail\n- `SubIssuesTable` now shows an \"Add sub-issue\" link even when there are no children yet\n- Added a \"+\" button next to the \"Sub-issues\" header when children exist\n- Both trigger an inline input row at the bottom of the table\n- Enter creates the issue with `parent_id` pre-set, Esc cancels\n\n### Supporting changes\n- Added `parent_id` to `createIssue` payload type in the frontend API client\n- Added `handleParentChange` callback using the existing `UPDATE` draft path (`parent_id` field)"},"created_at":"2026-05-20T19:52:20.638148Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
