{"id":"beats-8b30be","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-05-28T07:13:53.844731973Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.152 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-8b30be","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-058dfe3d-93c9-4a5f-8cdf-6d7b3f937f4e","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded `internal/server/handlers_test.go` with 14 table-style tests covering all major handler paths:\n\n- `GET /api/issues` — empty and with data\n- `GET /api/issues/{id}` — found and 404\n- `POST /api/draft` — create, bad JSON (400), unknown event type (400)\n- `GET /api/pending` — empty\n- `DELETE /api/pending` — discard clears buffer\n- `GET /api/config` — returns prefix\n- `GET /api/issues/{id}/history` — empty and with events\n- `GET /api/activity` — empty\n- `GET /api/metrics` — happy path\n\nUses `httptest.NewRecorder` + the server's `setupRoutes()` mux, with a temp `.beats` directory per test. All 14 tests pass."},"created_at":"2026-05-28T07:15:31.138189871Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.152 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-8b30be","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-05-28T07:15:31.457494148Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.152 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-0ed889","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-d88de33d-1f8d-48a8-9037-f0408b7e4d97","text":"## Final Summary\n\nMajor refactor of the beats codebase for production-ready maintainability, covering both the React frontend and Go backend.\n\n### Frontend — Module Decomposition\n\n**Shared utilities extracted (eliminated duplication):**\n- `utils/format.ts` — 6 functions previously duplicated across 2–3 files each\n- `ui/SubProgress.tsx` — shared component previously copy-pasted in 3 files\n- `ui/InlineDropdown.tsx` — reusable dropdown extracted from App.tsx\n- `ui/ErrorBoundary.tsx` — crash recovery for render errors\n\n**Large files broken into focused modules:**\n\n| Original file | Before | After | Extracted modules |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `IssueDetail.tsx` | 1,648 | 352 | PropertySidebar, ActivityTimeline, SubIssuesTable, icons |\n| `Backlog.tsx` | 1,636 | 603 | DndComponents, useBacklogRows |\n| `Dashboard.tsx` | 1,017 | 368 | Section, charts, ActivityFeed, DistributionSection |\n| `App.tsx` | 810 | 296 | NewIssueModal |\n| `Board.tsx` | 547 | 284 | BoardCard, BoardColumn |\n\n**API client hardened:**\n- `ApiError` class with status code + server message\n- Shared `request\u003cT\u003e()` helper replacing 15 duplicated fetch patterns\n- Key consumers now surface errors in toasts/logs\n\n### Backend — Go Refactoring\n\n- `handlers.go` split into `handlers.go` (HTTP glue) + `responses.go` (types, serialization, filters)\n- 14 new handler tests in `handlers_test.go` covering all API endpoints\n\n### Sub-issues\n- beats-725c2f — Error boundary ✅\n- beats-781691 — Structured API error handling ✅\n- beats-8b30be — Server handler tests ✅\n- beats-47011a — Split handlers.go ✅"},"created_at":"2026-05-28T07:17:53.766505279Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.152 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
